## Import

Import a cluster overload simulation by using the project ID, cluster name, and simulation ID in the format `PROJECT_ID/CLUSTER_NAME/SIMULATION_ID`, for example:

```shell
terraform import mongodbatlas_cluster_overload_simulation.this 0123456789abcdef01234567/Cluster0/89abcdef0123456701234567
```
